Given the following Java code for preorder DFS, rewrite the variable and function names, so it becomes clearer. 

class Solution {
    public List<Integer> f(TreeNode r) {
        List<Integer> l=new ArrayList<Integer>();
        po(r,l);
        return l;
    }
    public void po(TreeNode r,List<Integer> l){
        if(r==null) return ;
        l.add(r.val);
        po(r.left,list);
        po(r.right,list);
    }
}

